constraints:
1 <= n <= 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(n)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def ZigZagMaxLength(self, nums):
		inc = 1
		dec = 1
		for i in range(1, len(nums)):
			if nums[i] > nums[i - 1]:
				inc = dec + 1
			elif nums[i] < nums[i - 1]:
				dec = inc + 1
		return max(inc, dec)
